116" lrx="917" lry="1151" /><zone xml:id="m-70e2fac2-8f9d-438b-baff-b6fe509affc9" ulx="29" uly="1122" lrx="467" lry="1156" /><zone xml:id="m-cf2eaa67-9c0e-4dc5-beca-1feb68876f00" ulx="478" uly="1142" lrx="916" lry="1178" /><zone xml:id="m-bb2b285c-24c2-4a17-92fe-a0e41595c557" ulx="31" uly="1145" lrx="468" lry="1183" /><zone xml:id="m-67d017b2-ff95-4c53-ac29-71d27438f1f3" ulx="478" uly="1171" lrx="917" lry="1204" /><zone xml:id="m-7225b4e3-4387-47da-80cd-8c65f2111944" ulx="30" uly="1176" lrx="467" lry="1211" /><zone xml:id="m-7ef75fe1-cdca-4d8a-b10a-e3f35dd942f2" ulx="30" uly="1199" lrx="468" lry="1240" /><zone xml:id="m-1ab7a97d-b72e-4e4d-90e3-4a7ba81108b7" ulx="480" uly="1200" lrx="917" lry="1237" /><zone xml:id="m-51be1c4a-2f18-4103-848f-31947d91641e" ulx="478" uly="1226" lrx="916" lry="1263" /><zone xml:id="m-7fcc4222-ee62-490e-bcc7-e49497ed4714" ulx="29" uly="1229" lrx="469" lry="1264" /><zone xml:id="m-fd4b9cef-fa8b-42ac-b720-b122e9de737e" ulx="28" uly="1257" lrx="470" lry="1292" /><zone xml:id="m-fda7a5d9-85e9-4b6b-8ae7-00853242a220" ulx="476" uly="1259" lrx="592" lry="1290" /><zone xml:id="m-4f9365fd-fad7-4dac-81d1-c1f409b11cc2" ulx="639" uly="1282" lrx="861" lry="1316" /><zone xml:id="m-c0a24086-8fa5-42e1-881c-413ef6426251" ulx="28" uly="1284" lrx="473" lry="1324" /><zone xml:id="m-9f33e55e-4437-4939-9782-caea5fa246a1" ulx="423" uly="1323" lrx="523" lry="1361" /><zone xml:id="m-2fe69d8d-a077-493e-9857-79226ee3debc" ulx="42" uly="1355" lrx="917" lry="1396" /><zone xml:id="m-a37a33d3-5a70-4bad-8a35-4bdec47d5807" ulx="35" uly="1387" lrx="912" lry="1429" /><zone xml:id="m-ed4f794a-e6a3-4f4a-a8d8-70fa237466ea" ulx="29" uly="1417" lrx="618" lry="1456" /><zone xml:id="m-3132c6f7-0a25-4f8e-bec8-eb80107ad2b6" ulx="352" uly="1458" lrx="595" lry="1491" /><zone xml:id="m-36d13f8b-d87b-4716-9bdd-520227ee5090" ulx="71" uly="1488" lrx="916" lry="1531" /><zone xml:id="m-41cfa347-3051-405d-8cbc-1a42b85ae878" ulx="31" uly="1518" lrx="469" lry="1557" /><zone xml:id="m-60cb6d4a-f36f-4b08-a9c1-f7fb9aaa4213" ulx="481" uly="1523" lrx="614" lry="1555" /><zone xml:id="m-ba3883a5-6615-4a26-b286-7d590a934b73" ulx="28" uly="1553" lrx="467" lry="1588" /><zone xml:id="m-bf7c74b3-7fa7-4cd7-8e4d-bcb0120098ad" ulx="95" uly="1591" lrx="241" lry="1631" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-432e6cc3-0c8d-41ea-aa9f-20b194487ab4" n="1601" facs="#m-e0f5e22b-a248-45de-854f-1076e206af58" /><div xml:id="m-908b0b56-da4b-4c51-b81b-da1e9c0292ce">
            <lg xml:id="m-f9baf847-608d-448e-9c16-ccb390b3c858">
              <l xml:id="m-d58035ab-4bc0-44c0-80f3-c5162a36b3b6" facs="#m-1a3c8ee2-a1ff-4810-8498-a28274413cc1" label="ambiguous">March 7.</l><l xml:id="m-db1c8fc4-dc10-4ff6-98aa-338d17da492f" facs="#m-22010bc1-3079-428c-ba1c-36316b4174d8" label="ambiguous">1397</l><l xml:id="m-a6ea3d93-d7ce-4d99-aba5-d8d56b1e1a51" facs="#m-cc004660-8e78-45d8-ae05-4dcfc80050b0" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-6737cb46-ffff-4d3c-83d3-5c420c2158f0" facs="#m-84f02c09-a0c0-400a-b517-7deeeceec126" label="lyrics-like">nobis, quaésumus Dómine venerári: t ut quas digna mente</l><l xml:id="m-bb103cb4-f72e-46cc-9e3c-2da6d9018792" facs="#m-e921b409-e05a-451c-943c-e635b13ecc2e" label="lyrics-like">U Deus noster, sanctárum Már- non póssumus celebrâre, * humíli¬</l><l xml:id="m-a8a7aed5-f793-4361-ac2b-e1de03982c58" facs="#m-9dfb6c0a-9e11-4782-9aa8-e0d27e9aeccc" label="lyrics-like">tyrum tuárum Perpétuae et Felici- bus saltem frequentémus obséquiis</l><l xml:id="m-89002863-5ea5-4533-bade-a9a0271627ab" facs="#m-a3e124c4-daee-4239-95bc-233d130ff199" label="lyrics-like">tátis palmas incessábili devotiône! Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-c166d358-2fba-43b0-96a6-0e49a46ae1f7" facs="#m-cac448ae-471b-49ec-b5a7-690f0897dc02" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Inténde. p. 1238.</l><l xml:id="m-3443d286-3034-40ee-9d11-fb515ccd5e84" facs="#m-0a2d976c-f05d-44a4-970e-1ef260173fde" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-e2d15125-99dd-41cc-ae13-07527e8d3e84" facs="#m-ed982dc9-2bc6-4bc3-92f8-066c47c5eb5a" label="lyrics-like">Ysticis, Dómine, repléti sumus pétuae et Felicitátis, quae tempo¬</l><l xml:id="m-2539cdd8-20d3-4c8b-8e57-5fdf5373a269" facs="#m-c5a9f438-7f71-4034-9e0d-6ab2761f86ac" label="lyrics-like">SIl votis et gáudis: praesta,</l><l xml:id="m-42f67c7e-be1f-445a-a754-e5cb2e3ccaec" facs="#m-c9a22ebd-a3b1-4087-8a77-92bff81aa3f2" label="lyrics-like">ráliter ágimus, spirituáliter conse¬</l><l xml:id="m-be2a9d0d-e807-4804-8476-90678483c270" facs="#m-07ffa553-69fa-4387-b338-5e8d944034ed" label="lyrics-like">quaésumus; ut intercessiónibus quámur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-1ba7dccc-b19a-480a-af95-78ae65021870" facs="#m-b708b239-05bf-4ddb-8645-2480a6b6824a" label="lyrics-like">sanctárum Mártyrum tuárum Per¬</l><l xml:id="m-d1a0742e-0b27-4a35-b179-cece5a1e0007" facs="#m-08e6b11b-1c97-4f5d-946c-b27a0fb0b555" label="text-like">St. Thomas of Aquin,</l><l xml:id="m-8a4fca0d-3fad-4aed-bed8-a556045c72b6" facs="#m-ba3e4126-40ca-45b2-b7b0-cc737d596ce3" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-19ef450a-58f4-4030-9541-d752eddb3983" facs="#m-66ce2947-0151-4c4c-b931-43b43b1ef19c" label="text-like">Confessor and Doctor of the Church.</l><l xml:id="m-f80f33b7-662f-4537-bc65-86eb3c3b797f" facs="#m-7d91642c-d821-404d-85f0-fb697a3da6ad" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-67577f8f-1aff-4ff7-95e1-98da91b361eb" facs="#m-7fb38e8a-327d-4be2-9cbc-7a4a70a8578f" label="lyrics-like">At Ist and 2nd Vespers, at Magn. Ant. O Dóctor... beáte Thóma. p. 2625.</l><l xml:id="m-6865e211-eea5-40c9-9b5e-ae30c9f15c89" facs="#m-682aec71-0f2d-4b26-b156-3b2168599fa6" label="lyrics-like">Mass. In médio. from the Common of Doctors, p. 1190, except the</l><l xml:id="m-76ab3f20-0d7a-4f59-b17b-67aa8049eb67" facs="#m-2c221ad3-3598-4667-a983-34e2e1ee045e" label="ambiguous">following:</l><l xml:id="m-11cc72e2-ca5d-4216-a5c4-9e764425ad48" facs="#m-720532a2-f313-44c7-9fe2-ae60423a5c96" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-279ef5df-f4ee-40cf-900c-fecc68f56ded" facs="#m-1f656986-85f0-42e5-bff9-3193d4709004" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui Ecclésiam tuam beáti quaésumus; et quae dócuit intel¬</l><l xml:id="m-bc72fe13-c00a-440d-b69c-8a030a7770c2" facs="#m-dbb2f7a5-6d5e-41d9-9c6e-10b9f86e89c6" label="lyrics-like">I Thomae Confessóris tui miral léctu conspicere, * et quae egit</l><l xml:id="m-7320ab67-51ac-4fc2-a65e-f62a2099f766" facs="#m-782775c3-5544-43af-9c81-2514400f0fe8" label="lyrics-like">eruditióne claríficas, et sancta ope-imitatióne complère. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d1f2f85f-5454-4c98-8e2e-d30098ffc9e7" facs="#m-b06bcd2f-29e0-473c-89e4-c6442a70ca83" label="lyrics-like">ratióne fecúndas: t da nobis,</l><l xml:id="m-a4183cc8-b52c-4def-8f0f-5b266aa62395" facs="#m-c360532b-04eb-4cac-86c8-b1b7aed41565" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Sapientiae. Sap. 7.</l><l xml:id="m-7ebfbb89-8a9e-4ca5-a323-c9b027a2e35e" facs="#m-6edacf53-2623-44a8-843c-c22d5a8c6c49" label="lyrics-like">Ptávi, et datus est mihi sensus: ómnia bona páriter cum illa, et</l><l xml:id="m-a590c826-9111-4f3f-8061-140d31a216f5" facs="#m-95d60b28-b81b-467f-86ba-d65bea9dbab7" label="lyrics-like">innumerábilis honéstas per manus</l><l xml:id="m-fc467026-6bac-4a09-8702-d00caa59ccaa" facs="#m-f4bf9994-ed94-4fee-ae9a-7d47e47d4f1f" label="lyrics-like">et invocávi, et venit in me spí¬</l><l xml:id="m-304443d7-5a0a-487a-96f4-6ec781c5e628" facs="#m-538d8752-071e-4050-b20e-6f97e1dbfe91" label="lyrics-like">illius, et laetátus sum in ómnibus,</l><l xml:id="m-7132e9f2-fdf0-485c-93a4-fb39ba1a345f" facs="#m-e94123f4-b054-455a-b2f4-67930e15bc5f" label="lyrics-like">ritus sapiéntiae : et praepósui illam</l><l xml:id="m-3ac6a622-8be9-4e56-9485-795c310894c6" facs="#m-d1d26b82-f433-4034-a606-41f211b94ed3" label="lyrics-like">quóniam antecedébat me ista sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-66b0667f-82e4-4ffc-86fe-fce1118f4c89" facs="#m-621e0c26-9156-4fd9-9853-94474704ebd8" label="lyrics-like">regnis et sédibus, ét divitias nihil</l><l xml:id="m-52853381-5419-40c7-a451-9ac8488a3bf7" facs="#m-c9e5fd80-2d5b-4dde-9d93-6921628c037a" label="lyrics-like">piéntia: et ignorábam quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-21c6cdeb-0019-4e7a-bd6d-b97fd67131be" facs="#m-d2b11d57-97bf-4815-aecf-e19dc394335a" label="lyrics-like">esse duxi in comparatióne illius:</l><l xml:id="m-6e6acb4a-462a-4356-849a-b3dac1454c53" facs="#m-8b8cadca-9ae9-4a1c-8ead-e999ee2d91aa" label="lyrics-like">horum ómnium mater est. Quam</l><l xml:id="m-2c082abb-bd6d-4ad1-a839-8fd1f7935077" facs="#m-0dc46749-5228-4b89-b72f-f69432fb34a9" label="lyrics-like">nec comparávi illi lápidem pretió¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7ded188-ba49-4200-ab85-fc33fd222f17" facs="#m-83869ae9-0c2f-4d27-ab33-a9d7a7be60d5" label="lyrics-like">sine fictióne didici, et sine invidia</l><l xml:id="m-6458e310-bbb9-49a7-8567-d04544c32997" facs="#m-df5f22b0-74d1-4980-99db-828e2d9cac9c" label="lyrics-like">sum: quóniam omne aurum in</l><l xml:id="m-e205c502-2352-4172-8998-e5ec67a01a59" facs="#m-e7dc8491-ac55-4c39-a40b-68d8c14c7c64" label="lyrics-like">commúnico, et honestátem illius</l><l xml:id="m-55899e1c-8e00-4815-9f32-77e14ef3d0de" facs="#m-70e2fac2-8f9d-438b-baff-b6fe509affc9" label="lyrics-like">comparatióne illius, aréna est exí¬</l><l xml:id="m-edd14ad1-142b-4f3d-a083-a82218f90e66" facs="#m-cf2eaa67-9c0e-4dc5-beca-1feb68876f00" label="lyrics-like">non abscóndo. Infinstus enim the¬</l><l xml:id="m-ef9f437e-6c69-4dc8-9daa-14eca0bd3d47" facs="#m-bb2b285c-24c2-4a17-92fe-a0e41595c557" label="lyrics-like">gua, et tamquam lutum aestimá¬</l><l xml:id="m-3f93550d-5b58-4158-8807-104ebe9c6116" facs="#m-67d017b2-ff95-4c53-ac29-71d27438f1f3" label="lyrics-like">sáurus est homínibus: quo qui usi</l><l xml:id="m-f6ccf1d3-6289-4ac6-b373-ef5e343d08b3" facs="#m-7225b4e3-4387-47da-80cd-8c65f2111944" label="lyrics-like">bitur argéntum in conspéctu illius.</l><l xml:id="m-1f6bbdab-01a8-485a-ab21-de8dc792b791" facs="#m-7ef75fe1-cdca-4d8a-b10a-e3f35dd942f2" label="lyrics-like">Super salútem et spéciem diléxi</l><l xml:id="m-16f98abe-a1a9-48b1-9780-10ef5d204171" facs="#m-1ab7a97d-b72e-4e4d-90e3-4a7ba81108b7" label="lyrics-like">sunt, partícipes facti sunt amicitiae</l><l xml:id="m-cbe4c8e9-f296-4a2c-90a6-4f0478944ca5" facs="#m-51be1c4a-2f18-4103-848f-31947d91641e" label="ambiguous">Dei, propter disciplinae dona com¬</l><l xml:id="m-341f4ebd-f622-4e71-86af-5376a69ea029" facs="#m-7fcc4222-ee62-490e-bcc7-e49497ed4714" label="lyrics-like">illam, et propósui pro luce habére</l><l xml:id="m-69192726-8c4d-4374-a648-e912100e15ef" facs="#m-fd4b9cef-fa8b-42ac-b720-b122e9de737e" label="lyrics-like">illam: quóniam inexstinguibile est</l><l xml:id="m-f85cd25e-6fc8-4586-ad55-d8ee45fcb685" facs="#m-fda7a5d9-85e9-4b6b-8ae7-00853242a220" label="lyrics-like">mendáti.</l><l xml:id="m-531ef319-4a4e-4ab6-86bd-4523cd496085" facs="#m-4f9365fd-fad7-4dac-81d1-c1f409b11cc2" label="text-like">The Credo. is said.</l><l xml:id="m-2b1b5ada-de63-4d65-8d97-7fca5aef5342" facs="#m-c0a24086-8fa5-42e1-881c-413ef6426251" label="lyrics-like">lumen illius. Venérunt aũtem mihi</l><l xml:id="m-d1813130-9d2a-4954-897d-47e757be734d" facs="#m-9f33e55e-4437-4939-9782-caea5fa246a1" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-5c0d0fdc-37a1-4a18-bb95-b4c965cc75a0" facs="#m-2fe69d8d-a077-493e-9857-79226ee3debc" label="lyrics-like">NAncti Thomae Confessóris tui nera nostra conciliet, et tuam nobis</l><l xml:id="m-c20bb585-0ad3-4387-a5da-7081d65fdc90" facs="#m-a37a33d3-5a70-4bad-8a35-4bdec47d5807" label="lyrics-like">atque Doctóris, nobis. Dómine, lindulgéntiam semper obtineat. Per</l><l xml:id="m-c57d12bf-a93d-4774-a59b-34378e13b0c6" facs="#m-ed4f794a-e6a3-4f4a-a8d8-70fa237466ea" label="lyrics-like">pia non desit oratio : quae et mú- Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3045053c-cb2c-458f-85da-d139903e67e8" facs="#m-3132c6f7-0a25-4f8e-bec8-eb80107ad2b6" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-35562883-a54c-4952-890f-0418b13967ef" facs="#m-36d13f8b-d87b-4716-9bdd-520227ee5090" label="lyrics-like">T nobis, Dómine, tua sacrifícia! quaésumus, precátor accédat. Per</l><l xml:id="m-971c4c24-b13d-4625-a996-224c41da7bf4" facs="#m-41cfa347-3051-405d-8cbc-1a42b85ae878" label="lyrics-like">(l dent salútem: beátus Thomas</l><l xml:id="m-87e5c66f-dd4a-4232-a409-05080177b92a" facs="#m-60cb6d4a-f36f-4b08-a9c1-f7fb9aaa4213" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2a3da9f2-bb5d-4bd8-a2f2-06ced89ab6ad" facs="#m-ba3883a5-6615-4a26-b286-7d590a934b73" label="lyrics-like">Conféssor tuus et Doctor egrégius.</l><l xml:id="m-5d865817-c883-4267-9767-b1d303ebc727" facs="#m-bf7c74b3-7fa7-4cd7-8e4d-bcb0120098ad" label="ambiguous">N° 801 — 81</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>